      "id": "gtm-positioning-system",
      "name": "GTM 与定位系统",
      "summary": "把 ICP、beachhead、定位、价值主张、竞品 battlecard 和 launch 计划合成上市路径。",
      "growth_process": "增长经营",
      "journey_stage": "认知/到达",
